From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 04:43:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 36/40] frames: draw X11 window frames in Kestrel's style

Load a stylesheet with Kestrel's title bar, title and window buttons,
and the colors Kestrel writes to ~/.config/kestrel/appearance.css,
reloading them when they change. Both follow the light or dark style
through prefers-color-scheme, which the helper now sets through
gtk-interface-color-scheme when libadwaita isn't loaded. The title sits
at the start of the bar like in Kestrel's own windows.
---
